    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_FAMILIARS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Can train Familiars (national unit, 4).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Bind: a Familiar binds to the caster of the highest level in its stack.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]In battle it takes the first spell or shot aimed at its caster; the auto formation puts it in its caster's lane.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The caster gains 1 XP a turn while they share a plot.",
